1
00:00:10,173 --> 00:00:13,258
A car. A dream. A wave function.

2
00:00:13,338 --> 00:00:15,070
Which of them is the real one?

3
00:00:15,902 --> 00:00:18,689
I am John Tan, known as Thusness.

4
00:00:18,769 --> 00:00:22,960
These are my own notes, from my
own practice and contemplation.

5
00:00:23,765 --> 00:00:28,861
In Part 1, a bell, a red flower and
a passing thought were looked for,

6
00:00:28,941 --> 00:00:34,826
and not found. In Parts 2 and 3, the
habit retreated to the smallest moment,

7
00:00:34,906 --> 00:00:37,856
the smallest piece, and space itself.

8
00:00:37,936 --> 00:00:40,048
And found no floor in any of them.

9
00:00:40,857 --> 00:00:42,856
So the habit tries something else.

10
00:00:42,936 --> 00:00:46,388
It stops digging down,
and starts ranking across.

11
00:00:46,468 --> 00:00:50,781
What appears, it notices,
appears in very different ways.

12
00:00:51,589 --> 00:00:54,674
Some of it appears solid, and undeniable.

13
00:00:54,754 --> 00:00:56,916
A ball can be tossed and caught.

14
00:00:56,996 --> 00:00:58,877
A car can knock a person down.

15
00:00:59,681 --> 00:01:05,647
Some of it appears dreamlike. A thought.
A feeling. A memory. A dream at night.

16
00:01:05,727 --> 00:01:07,839
No weight, and no edges.

17
00:01:08,661 --> 00:01:11,873
And some of it is never
met at all. Only described.

18
00:01:12,003 --> 00:01:16,801
Physics speaks of fields, and
probability waves, and wave functions.

19
00:01:16,881 --> 00:01:18,554
Nobody has ever seen one.

20
00:01:18,634 --> 00:01:23,164
And yet they predict what we will see,
better than anything else we have.

21
00:01:23,990 --> 00:01:26,614
The habit cannot leave these side by side.

22
00:01:26,694 --> 00:01:30,763
It picks one as the real one,
and makes the others its shadow.

23
00:01:30,892 --> 00:01:36,089
For one person, the solid is real,
and the mind is a shadow of it.

24
00:01:36,205 --> 00:01:40,749
For another, the mind is real,
and matter is its projection.

25
00:01:40,852 --> 00:01:43,842
For a third, the
equations are the reality,

26
00:01:43,922 --> 00:01:46,917
and the apple is only how they look to us.

27
00:01:47,741 --> 00:01:52,239
So here I set the two ways of
seeing side by side, three times.

28
00:01:52,319 --> 00:01:54,019
Once for each candidate.

29
00:01:54,099 --> 00:01:56,900
Then I look at a fourth,
quieter candidate.

30
00:01:56,980 --> 00:01:58,861
The web of conditions itself.

31
00:01:59,727 --> 00:02:00,983
First, a car.

32
00:02:02,245 --> 00:02:06,349
In Section 1, the car knocked me
down without needing an essence.

33
00:02:06,429 --> 00:02:08,048
Here the question is different.

34
00:02:08,128 --> 00:02:10,348
Is the solid the most real of all?

35
00:02:11,153 --> 00:02:14,918
Surely it is. The car
is hard, heavy and fast.

36
00:02:14,998 --> 00:02:18,016
It does not care what I think
of it. Thoughts come and go.

37
00:02:18,096 --> 00:02:20,026
Dreams fade by breakfast.

38
00:02:20,106 --> 00:02:21,847
But the car is there in the morning.

39
00:02:21,927 --> 00:02:24,116
And if it hits me, I am hurt.

40
00:02:24,196 --> 00:02:27,037
Whatever else is real, matter is real.

41
00:02:27,117 --> 00:02:31,430
And everything else, mind
included, is something matter does.

42
00:02:32,253 --> 00:02:36,457
Or, and it is a big or, look
at how the solid appears.

43
00:02:37,286 --> 00:02:39,448
The hardness is met in the hand.

44
00:02:39,528 --> 00:02:42,247
The weight is met in
the muscles that push.

45
00:02:42,327 --> 00:02:47,138
The speed is met by the eye, and
the impact by a body that bruises.

46
00:02:47,218 --> 00:02:51,201
Take away the hand, the
muscles, the eye and the body.

47
00:02:51,281 --> 00:02:53,597
What would hard or heavy still mean?

48
00:02:54,426 --> 00:02:56,955
Solidity is not stored in the metal.

49
00:02:57,035 --> 00:03:01,579
It is a resistance that forms when two
systems with the right coupling meet.

50
00:03:01,682 --> 00:03:03,957
For a body, the car is a wall.

51
00:03:04,059 --> 00:03:07,082
For a neutrino, it is almost open space.

52
00:03:07,881 --> 00:03:12,149
And look for the car itself, as
Candrakīrti looked for the chariot.

53
00:03:12,229 --> 00:03:17,774
Not the wheels. Not the engine. Not the
frame. Not their sum. Not their shape.

54
00:03:17,854 --> 00:03:20,889
It is not found. Yet
it carries me to work.

55
00:03:21,709 --> 00:03:25,093
So the solid is not more
real than anything else.

56
00:03:25,173 --> 00:03:26,792
It is one way of appearing.

57
00:03:26,872 --> 00:03:28,477
The way that pushes back.

58
00:03:28,557 --> 00:03:31,982
Vivid, not found, and dependently arisen,

59
00:03:32,062 --> 00:03:33,793
exactly like the bell.

60
00:03:34,601 --> 00:03:37,727
And nothing is missing. The
car still knocks you down.

61
00:03:37,807 --> 00:03:40,435
I still look both ways before I cross.

62
00:03:41,266 --> 00:03:42,794
Second, a dream.

63
00:03:43,825 --> 00:03:48,527
Take a dream. In it, someone
dear who has died is alive again.

64
00:03:48,607 --> 00:03:52,051
I speak with them, and
wake with tears on my face.

65
00:03:52,866 --> 00:03:57,447
Surely, then, the mind is what
is real. The dream proves it.

66
00:03:57,527 --> 00:04:01,876
There was no one in the room. Yet they
were vivid, and the grief was real.

67
00:04:01,956 --> 00:04:04,525
If the mind can make a
whole world at night,

68
00:04:04,605 --> 00:04:07,800
perhaps the daytime world
is made the same way.

69
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:12,492
Matter is only how the mind's contents
appear. The mind is the floor.

70
00:04:13,305 --> 00:04:17,794
Or, and again it is a big or,
look at how the dream appears.

71
00:04:18,626 --> 00:04:21,019
The dream was vivid, and it worked.

72
00:04:21,099 --> 00:04:22,704
It moved me to tears.

73
00:04:22,784 --> 00:04:25,870
But look for the one in the
dream. They are not in the room.

74
00:04:25,950 --> 00:04:28,682
Look for them in the
mind. Where is that mind?

75
00:04:28,762 --> 00:04:31,676
It is not found, any more than the car is.

76
00:04:32,489 --> 00:04:37,395
And the dream came from conditions too.
The years together. The missing of them.

77
00:04:37,475 --> 00:04:40,670
A song heard the day
before. The body asleep.

78
00:04:40,750 --> 00:04:43,894
Take those away, and
that dream does not come.

79
00:04:44,709 --> 00:04:48,161
So the dreamlike is not more
real than the solid either.

80
00:04:48,241 --> 00:04:52,473
A thought is as unfindable
as a stone, and as dependent.

81
00:04:53,281 --> 00:04:57,005
Losing the solid floor does
not hand the floor to the mind.

82
00:04:57,085 --> 00:05:01,380
Making mind the floor and making
matter the floor are one mistake,

83
00:05:01,460 --> 00:05:03,192
made in two directions.

84
00:05:03,989 --> 00:05:08,352
And nothing is missing. The grief
was grief. The tears were wet.

85
00:05:08,432 --> 00:05:10,163
And the missing is still there.

86
00:05:11,031 --> 00:05:12,994
Third, a wave function.

87
00:05:13,826 --> 00:05:18,071
Then the third candidate. The one
many careful people trust most.

88
00:05:18,174 --> 00:05:23,502
Physics does not ask how the car feels,
or what the dream means. It describes.

89
00:05:23,582 --> 00:05:26,794
And its descriptions are
astonishingly reliable.

90
00:05:27,593 --> 00:05:31,426
Surely, then, the
description is the reality.

91
00:05:31,506 --> 00:05:36,861
Underneath the solid car and the dreaming
mind are fields and wave functions.

92
00:05:36,941 --> 00:05:38,885
Exact, and impersonal.

93
00:05:38,965 --> 00:05:42,920
The apple and the bell are just how
these look to creatures like us.

94
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,745
The equations are the floor.

95
00:05:45,549 --> 00:05:49,998
Or, and it is the biggest or,
look at how the described appears.

96
00:05:50,809 --> 00:05:52,807
Nobody has met a wave function.

97
00:05:52,887 --> 00:05:55,090
It appears as symbols on a page.

98
00:05:55,170 --> 00:05:58,365
And as predictions that
match clicks on a detector.

99
00:05:58,445 --> 00:06:02,060
It is built from measurements,
models, instruments,

100
00:06:02,140 --> 00:06:05,624
and the agreement of many
people over centuries.

101
00:06:06,437 --> 00:06:08,653
Section 1 looked closely at this.

102
00:06:08,733 --> 00:06:13,096
A measured value is a fact relative
to the system that interacts.

103
00:06:13,176 --> 00:06:17,580
And the cut between the thing and the
instrument is drawn by the whole setup,

104
00:06:17,660 --> 00:06:19,473
not found already drawn.

105
00:06:20,302 --> 00:06:25,182
So the scientific descriptions are among
the most reliable designations we have,

106
00:06:25,262 --> 00:06:26,907
within their domains.

107
00:06:26,987 --> 00:06:29,733
I honour them, and I use them every day.

108
00:06:29,813 --> 00:06:31,554
But they are designations too.

109
00:06:31,634 --> 00:06:35,852
A field is no better a candidate for
what is really there than an apple.

110
00:06:36,661 --> 00:06:38,691
And one caution belongs here.

111
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:41,173
Physics does not show
that things are empty.

112
00:06:41,253 --> 00:06:43,592
And emptiness does not need physics.

113
00:06:43,672 --> 00:06:45,389
At most, it is an echo.

114
00:06:46,193 --> 00:06:49,672
And nothing is missing. The
equations still predict.

115
00:06:49,752 --> 00:06:51,928
The satellites still guide my car.

116
00:06:52,008 --> 00:06:54,786
And the medicine designed
from them still works.

117
00:06:55,605 --> 00:06:58,853
So the three ways of appearing
have each been looked for.

118
00:06:58,933 --> 00:07:00,552
And none of them is the floor.

119
00:07:00,632 --> 00:07:05,457
The solid, the dreamlike and the
described are all ways of appearing,

120
00:07:05,537 --> 00:07:08,423
and all three meet the same search.

121
00:07:09,241 --> 00:07:13,074
That is why this view is
neither realism nor mind only.

122
00:07:13,154 --> 00:07:14,912
And it is why I do not rank them.

123
00:07:15,738 --> 00:07:17,900
But here a quieter trap opens.

124
00:07:17,980 --> 00:07:19,793
And it catches careful people.

125
00:07:20,601 --> 00:07:23,510
When the mind tries to
say what an appearance is,

126
00:07:23,590 --> 00:07:25,507
it reaches for dependence.

127
00:07:25,587 --> 00:07:29,053
The red depends on the light,
the eye and the surface.

128
00:07:29,133 --> 00:07:32,545
The sound depends on the
bell, the air and the ear.

129
00:07:32,625 --> 00:07:37,319
An appearance, it seems, sits at
the centre of a web of relations.

130
00:07:38,138 --> 00:07:41,170
Surely, then, the web is what is real.

131
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:43,887
The apple is unfindable, granted.

132
00:07:43,967 --> 00:07:46,020
The bell is unfindable.

133
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:47,705
But the conditions are real.

134
00:07:47,785 --> 00:07:50,042
The relations are what is really there.

135
00:07:50,122 --> 00:07:53,076
Dependent arising itself is the floor.

136
00:07:53,897 --> 00:07:55,112
Or look at the web.

137
00:07:56,469 --> 00:07:59,582
Nāgārjuna examined the conditions first.

138
00:07:59,662 --> 00:08:04,459
The own nature of things, he said,
is not found in their conditions.

139
00:08:04,539 --> 00:08:07,462
And when things have no
existence of their own,

140
00:08:07,542 --> 00:08:13,372
when this exists, that comes to be cannot
describe one real thing producing another.

141
00:08:13,452 --> 00:08:16,416
He examined contact and
connection themselves.

142
00:08:16,496 --> 00:08:21,828
The meeting, what has met, and the one
who brings them together, are not found.

143
00:08:22,633 --> 00:08:26,411
So the conditions are as
unfindable as what they condition.

144
00:08:26,491 --> 00:08:29,917
They are not a solid network
hidden behind the appearance.

145
00:08:29,997 --> 00:08:33,603
They too are appearances,
as dreamlike as the apple.

146
00:08:34,421 --> 00:08:36,610
A relation needs what it relates.

147
00:08:36,690 --> 00:08:40,115
And what it relates is not
found apart from the relation.

148
00:08:40,195 --> 00:08:43,729
Relation and the things related
are designated together.

149
00:08:43,809 --> 00:08:46,981
Neither is first, and
neither is the ground.

150
00:08:47,806 --> 00:08:52,210
This matters, because the web is
the most respectable floor of all.

151
00:08:52,290 --> 00:08:54,982
It sounds like dependent arising itself.

152
00:08:55,062 --> 00:09:00,063
But dependent arising made into a
floor is no longer dependent arising.

153
00:09:00,143 --> 00:09:05,013
It is the old essence, spread thin
across the gaps between things.

154
00:09:05,821 --> 00:09:09,069
And nothing is missing.
The seed still needs water.

155
00:09:09,149 --> 00:09:12,534
Conditions still meet, and
what meets still works.

156
00:09:12,614 --> 00:09:16,588
Only really there, from their
own side, is taken from them.

157
00:09:17,393 --> 00:09:20,601
If the solid, the
dreamlike, the described,

158
00:09:20,681 --> 00:09:25,007
and even the conditions are all
unfindable, are they unreal?

159
00:09:25,834 --> 00:09:30,374
The tradition answers with
images. A magic show. A dream.

160
00:09:30,454 --> 00:09:34,427
A city of gandharvas seen
in the clouds. A mirage.

161
00:09:35,233 --> 00:09:37,870
The images are chosen for their two sides.

162
00:09:37,950 --> 00:09:40,846
A magician's elephant
walks across the stage,

163
00:09:40,926 --> 00:09:46,376
and the audience gasps. It is seen.
It frightens. It is not an elephant.

164
00:09:46,456 --> 00:09:48,753
A dream can make the dreamer weep.

165
00:09:48,833 --> 00:09:54,528
A mirage is seen, and thirsty travellers
turn towards it. None of these is nothing.

166
00:09:54,608 --> 00:09:58,513
What they lack is a nature of
their own, found when looked for.

167
00:09:59,333 --> 00:10:01,495
Nāgārjuna presses the point.

168
00:10:01,575 --> 00:10:04,769
Suppose the Buddha
conjured a magical person,

169
00:10:04,849 --> 00:10:07,011
and that person conjured another.

170
00:10:07,091 --> 00:10:09,592
The second is made, and it acts.

171
00:10:09,672 --> 00:10:15,340
In the same way, actions, agents and
their fruits are like magical creations.

172
00:10:15,420 --> 00:10:16,620
And they work.

173
00:10:17,241 --> 00:10:21,536
And when someone objected that an
empty argument cannot refute anything,

174
00:10:21,616 --> 00:10:25,793
he answered: one magically
created man can stop another.

175
00:10:26,605 --> 00:10:28,631
So the effects are fully real.

176
00:10:28,711 --> 00:10:32,055
The car injures, and no
essence is found doing it.

177
00:10:32,135 --> 00:10:33,726
The grief is grief.

178
00:10:33,806 --> 00:10:35,510
The medicine still heals.

179
00:10:36,329 --> 00:10:38,382
One way of putting this needs care.

180
00:10:38,462 --> 00:10:42,064
It is tempting to say that things
can work because they are empty.

181
00:10:42,144 --> 00:10:45,732
As if emptiness were a power
that makes function possible.

182
00:10:45,812 --> 00:10:47,716
Emptiness does not do anything.

183
00:10:47,796 --> 00:10:51,117
It is not a cause, a
condition, or a ground.

184
00:10:51,946 --> 00:10:53,583
The point is only this.

185
00:10:53,685 --> 00:10:56,771
Function never needed an
essence in the first place.

186
00:10:56,851 --> 00:10:58,782
And the reasoning runs the other way.

187
00:10:58,862 --> 00:11:02,722
If a thing had a nature of its
own, fixed from its own side,

188
00:11:02,802 --> 00:11:07,373
it could not arise, change or end.
Nothing could be done with it.

189
00:11:08,185 --> 00:11:11,397
Longchenpa built a whole
book on these images.

190
00:11:11,513 --> 00:11:13,268
Finding Rest in Illusion.

191
00:11:13,348 --> 00:11:17,113
A dream, a magical illusion,
a trick of the eye,

192
00:11:17,193 --> 00:11:23,193
a mirage, an echo, a city in the
clouds, a reflection, and an apparition.

193
00:11:23,348 --> 00:11:26,243
Each is vivid, and each is not found.

194
00:11:26,323 --> 00:11:31,692
As the title says, the point is not to
make the world seem thin. It is rest.

195
00:11:31,772 --> 00:11:33,585
Nothing in it needs to be held.

196
00:11:34,397 --> 00:11:38,153
So, which holds? The ranking,
or none of them privileged?

197
00:11:38,974 --> 00:11:43,623
By experience. I meet the car's
hardness, the dream's grief,

198
00:11:43,703 --> 00:11:45,579
and the physicist's prediction.

199
00:11:45,659 --> 00:11:48,718
Each is met vividly, each in its own way.

200
00:11:48,798 --> 00:11:53,573
At no point do I meet one of them standing
underneath the others, holding them up.

201
00:11:54,386 --> 00:11:58,994
By logic. Whichever is made the floor
meets the same search as the others,

202
00:11:59,074 --> 00:12:00,733
and fails the same way.

203
00:12:00,813 --> 00:12:02,513
Matter breaks into parts.

204
00:12:02,593 --> 00:12:05,067
The mind is not found when looked for.

205
00:12:05,147 --> 00:12:07,472
A description depends on the describing.

206
00:12:07,552 --> 00:12:12,463
And the web cannot be the floor either,
because a relation needs what it relates.

207
00:12:13,278 --> 00:12:19,190
By working. The car, the dream and the
equation each work in their own domain,

208
00:12:19,270 --> 00:12:24,557
reliably. None of them drives the others
from underneath. The dream moves me.

209
00:12:24,637 --> 00:12:27,628
The car stops me. The equation predicts.

210
00:12:27,708 --> 00:12:30,033
Conditions meet, and things work.

211
00:12:30,113 --> 00:12:32,605
Nothing needed to be
the floor for any of it.

212
00:12:33,429 --> 00:12:35,686
So ranking is not the truer view.

213
00:12:35,766 --> 00:12:41,766
It is the default one, carried by habit,
and by two little words. Really, and just.

214
00:12:41,988 --> 00:12:46,845
Really matter. Just mind. Really
equations. Just relations.

215
00:12:47,665 --> 00:12:51,783
None of this makes my everyday
words false. The car is solid.

216
00:12:51,863 --> 00:12:55,193
The dream was a dream. The
physics is good physics.

217
00:12:55,273 --> 00:12:57,136
And conditions are conditions.

218
00:12:57,216 --> 00:12:59,514
What fails is only the extra claim.

219
00:12:59,594 --> 00:13:03,309
One of them is what is really
there, and the rest are its shadow.

220
00:13:04,133 --> 00:13:06,593
And something eases when this is seen.

221
00:13:06,673 --> 00:13:11,526
I no longer need to decide which world
is the real one before I can live in it.

222
00:13:11,606 --> 00:13:16,584
The car, the dream and the equation
can each be met as they appear.

223
00:13:16,687 --> 00:13:19,709
Fully. Without one swallowing the others.

224
00:13:20,529 --> 00:13:25,032
This is Section 2, Part 4 of
the Dependent Arising series.

225
00:13:25,837 --> 00:13:30,268
In Part 5, I turn to the clarity
that runs through all appearing.

226
00:13:30,348 --> 00:13:32,921
And ask whether it needs
a knower behind it.

227
00:13:33,737 --> 00:13:37,126
And what experience is
like, when no layer is left.

